["<aside class=\"callout why\" role=\"note\"><div class=\"callout-t\">Why it matters</div><p>Harrison rain rusts steel overnight. Ten minutes after the hunt keeps the CZ accurate for decades.</p></aside><figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 330\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"When CZ says to clean the CZ 457: 1 each time you use it, 2 if you get it wet, 3 as soon as possible after shooting, 4 at least once a year in a temperate climate, 5 as often as once a month in a tropical or other demanding climate. In Harrison rain, rule 2 applies most hunting days.\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"330\" fill=\"#EEF1EA\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"27\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\">When to clean</text><rect x=\"14\" y=\"46\" width=\"372\" height=\"38\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"36\" cy=\"65\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"36\" y=\"70\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\">1</text><text x=\"58\" y=\"71\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">Each time you use it</text><rect x=\"14\" y=\"92\" width=\"372\" height=\"38\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"36\" cy=\"111\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#FF6A13\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"36\" y=\"116\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\">2</text><text x=\"58\" y=\"117\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">If it gets wet</text><rect x=\"14\" y=\"138\" width=\"372\" height=\"38\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"36\" cy=\"157\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"36\" y=\"162\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\">3</text><text x=\"58\" y=\"163\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">Soon after shooting</text><rect x=\"14\" y=\"184\" width=\"372\" height=\"38\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"36\" cy=\"203\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"36\" y=\"208\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\">4</text><text x=\"58\" y=\"209\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">At least once a year</text><rect x=\"14\" y=\"230\" width=\"372\" height=\"38\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"36\" cy=\"249\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"36\" y=\"254\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\">5</text><text x=\"58\" y=\"255\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">Monthly in harsh places</text><text x=\"16\" y=\"296\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#FF6A13\">Harrison rain: rule 2 most days (Tip).</text><text x=\"16\" y=\"318\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">CZ manual, page 9 (95%).</text></svg>\n</figure><ul><li>Each use, when wet, soon after shooting <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">95%</span>.</li><li>At least once a year <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">95%</span>.</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: when, in the manual's words</summary><ul><li>\"Clean the Rifle: each time you use it; if you get your rifle wet; as soon as possible after shooting; at least once a year in a temperate climate; as often as once a month in a tropical climate, or other demanding environments\" (95%, CZ manual page 9).</li><li>CZ safety rule 8: \"Always clean the firearm after use\" (95%, page 2).</li><li>Rimfire tip: .22 LR ammunition carries a wax that coats the bore; a freshly scrubbed bore may need 10 to 20 rounds before groups settle (85%, Tikka manual note on its rimfire models, via <a href=\"#/s/rimfire-22\">the .22 rimfire</a>). Many rimfire shooters clean the bore less often than the action for this reason (Tip).</li></ul></details>","<div class=\"steps\" data-n=\"5\"><div class=\"steps-head\"><b>Clean the CZ 457 in 5 steps</b><span class=\"steps-count\">1 of 5</span></div><div class=\"steps-track\"><figure class=\"step-frame\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Cleaning the CZ 457, step 1 of 5: Bolt out. Magazine out, bolt out (chapter 8).\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#EEF1EA\"/><circle cx=\"26\" cy=\"26\" r=\"14\" fill=\"#FF6A13\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"26\" y=\"31\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\">1</text><text x=\"48\" y=\"32\" font-size=\"17\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\">Bolt out</text><g transform=\"translate(0 40) scale(1.0)\"><path d=\"M14 108 L128 116 L140 118 L300 120 Q314 121 318 126 L318 132 Q300 138 250 140 L200 141 L162 141 Q150 141 146 150 L136 170 Q132 176 124 174 L120 172 Q126 156 122 146 Q112 142 96 146 L14 168 Z\" fill=\"#9A6B3F\"/><path d=\"M30 116 Q80 120 120 124\" stroke=\"#6E4A2A\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" fill=\"none\"/><rect x=\"7\" y=\"106\" width=\"8\" height=\"64\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#2B3034\"/><path d=\"M232 105 L390 107 L390 115 L232 117 Z\" fill=\"#4A5156\"/><rect x=\"386\" y=\"106\" width=\"5\" height=\"10\" rx=\"1\" fill=\"#2B3034\"/><rect x=\"255\" y=\"99\" width=\"16\" height=\"7\" rx=\"1.5\" fill=\"#2B3034\"/><rect x=\"266\" y=\"96\" width=\"4\" height=\"4\" fill=\"#2B3034\"/><path d=\"M374 107 L376 97 L388 97 L388 107 Z\" fill=\"#2B3034\"/><rect x=\"140\" y=\"102\" width=\"94